  "title": "音乐：井上凉子",
  "summary": "在广播电台发现的古早音乐专辑，曲绘很精美。 活泼可爱的画风和略显时代感的音乐令人无比遐想古早赛璐璐动漫的时代。 … 继续阅读 音乐：井上凉子 →",
  "content": "<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697347614013111372022817.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697347614013111372022817-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697354115233518450224743.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697354115233518450224743-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697363015191535388699680.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697363015191535388699680-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697372379716548862364939.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697372379716548862364939-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/69738649514363072781847.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/69738649514363072781847-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697394262189181319332461.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697394262189181319332461-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697408798021676596237067.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697408798021676596237067-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697415992496755409585635.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697415992496755409585635-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697427965169995339629418.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697427965169995339629418-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697434098894090396969655.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697434098894090396969655-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697445654720914937714878.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697445654720914937714878-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697458224389847761569560.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/697458224389847761569560-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>在广播电台发现的古早音乐专辑，曲绘很精美。</p>\n\n\n\n<p>活泼可爱的画风和略显时代感的音乐令人无比遐想古早赛璐璐动漫的时代。</p>\n\n\n\n<p>井上凉子也是Galgame系列ROOMMATE三部曲连续出场的同居女主，也就是类似于高中室友这样的设定。这是她的角色印象专辑。</p>\n\n\n\n<p>本系列三部曲游戏发布在世嘉土星的游戏机平台，其最大的特色是利用了土星游戏机内置的时钟组件，因而得以令游玩时间与现实同步，例如圣诞节。</p>\n\n\n\n<p>许多软件例如8GadgetPacks也有类似的彩蛋设计，但这一系列的游戏则是主打特色。此外，三部曲也被移植到PlayStation平台、但由于没有时钟系统，需要借助外部的PocketStation宠物机存储时钟与事件进度。</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/gaming/%e9%9f%b3%e4%b9%90%ef%bc%9a%e4%ba%95%e4%b8%8a%e5%87%89%e5%ad%90/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">来源</a></p>",
